{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓團BLACK PINK成員Jennie日前獲邀出席美國真人騷家族Kardashians成員Kylie Jenner在洛杉磯舉行的萬聖節派對，除了神還原荷里活電影《狂野時速2》的經典賽車手角色Suki，她又變身經典動畫《怪誕屍新娘》的詭異新娘Emily。昨日Jennie在社交網分享相關靚相，身穿白色喱士禮服的她谷胸上陣，手捧黑色花束，而她在派對上與音樂製作人Carter Gregory貼頭親暱合照，同樣掀起熱議。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:29.726491+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:03:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:26.586953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:23.879444+00:00","content_hash":"c9597fec92698f68108222431838750d7f17fc9f774708c9c9a366d79e81c62d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}